# The repo root .gitignore carries a blanket `*.wav` rule -- upstream RPCS3's,
# meant for audio dumps -- and it silently swallowed this app's menu sound
# effects. They are referenced unconditionally as R.raw.sfx_* by MenuSfx.kt, so
# a clean clone did not just lose its UI sounds: it could not compile at all,
# with fifteen "Unresolved reference 'sfx_nav_a'" errors and nothing to say why
# the file was missing.
#
# Same class as the ANGLE libraries and the same fix, un-ignored by pattern
# here. See jniLibs/.gitignore, which describes the identical trap with `*.so`.
!sfx_*.wav
